      "writtenOn": "2023-02-07T10:21:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Any reason this was reintroduced?",
      "revId": "59c8cf3b9bb6970f3c044fc73f761208a0585038",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "58667bd1_3bf4e395",
        "filename": "Cronet/tests/cts/src/android/net/http/cts/HttpEngineTest.java",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 104,
      "author": {
        "id": 1743321
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-07T10:54:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This needs to be recreated for every requests. Otherwise the new requests will end up using the old one, meaning that things like `mCallback.expectCallback(ResponseStep.ON_SUCCEEDED)` directly return, `mCallback.mResponseInfo` is pre-populated etc.",
      "parentUuid": "33a06387_245d697a",
      "revId": "59c8cf3b9bb6970f3c044fc73f761208a0585038",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "248b3442_af93c4eb",
        "filename": "Cronet/tests/cts/src/android/net/http/cts/HttpEngineTest.java",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 104,
      "author": {
        "id": 1976566
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-07T12:11:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not really. Setup() is called before each test run and thus creates a new instance of the callback class each time.\n\nhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/20295578/difference-between-before-beforeclass-beforeeach-and-beforeall",
      "parentUuid": "58667bd1_3bf4e395",
      "revId": "59c8cf3b9bb6970f3c044fc73f761208a0585038",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "174caa8a_6549e28a",
        "filename": "Cronet/tests/cts/src/android/net/http/cts/HttpEngineTest.java",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 104,
      "author": {
        "id": 1743321
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-07T14:24:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This test sends multiple requests inside the for loop (line 103-116). Each of these requests requires a new callback (for the reasons pointed out above), hence the creation.",
      "parentUuid": "248b3442_af93c4eb",
      "revId": "59c8cf3b9bb6970f3c044fc73f761208a0585038",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
